{"id": "drawdown_bounce", "family": "drawdown", "key": "return", "direction": -1, "zh": "比半年高点跌了很多的币已经超跌，后面容易反弹", "en": "Coins that have fallen far below their six-month high are oversold and tend to bounce.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "-1 * Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('high').ts_max(window=180, min_periods=144))", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "drawdown_weak", "family": "drawdown", "key": "return", "direction": 1, "zh": "比半年高点跌了很多的币走势弱，后面继续弱", "en": "Coins that have fallen far below their six-month high stay weak.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('high').ts_max(window=180, min_periods=144))", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "recovery_up", "family": "drawdown", "key": "return", "direction": 1, "zh": "从三个月低点涨回来很多的币，后面继续涨", "en": "Coins that have climbed well off their three-month low keep rising.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('low').ts_min(window=90, min_periods=72))", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "high_age_down", "family": "drawdown", "key": "return", "direction": 1, "zh": "离三个月高点过去的时间越久，币越弱", "en": "The longer it has been since a coin made its three-month high, the weaker it is.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "Factor('high').ts_argmax(window=90, min_periods=72)", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "accel_up", "family": "return_acceleration", "key": "return", "direction": 1, "zh": "最近一周涨幅超过前一周的币在加速，后面继续涨", "en": "Coins whose gain over the past week beats their gain over the week before are speeding up and keep rising.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=7)).ln() - Factor('close').lag(periods=7).safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=14)).ln()", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "accel_down", "family": "return_acceleration", "key": "return", "direction": -1, "zh": "最近一周涨得比前一周快的币已经过热，后面容易回落", "en": "Coins whose gain over the past week beats their gain over the week before are overheating and fall back.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "-1 * (Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=7)).ln() - Factor('close').lag(periods=7).safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=14)).ln())", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "own_moves_down", "family": "market_link", "key": "volatility", "direction": -1, "zh": "大盘解释不了的自身波动大的币，后面表现差", "en": "Coins with large moves of their own, beyond what the market explains, do worse afterwards.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "-1 * (Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=1)) - 1).demean().ts_std(window=20, min_periods=16)", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "own_moves_up", "family": "market_link", "key": "volatility", "direction": 1, "zh": "大盘解释不了的自身波动大的币有资金关注，后面表现好", "en": "Coins with large moves of their own, beyond what the market explains, have attention and do better afterwards.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "(Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=1)) - 1).demean().ts_std(window=20, min_periods=16)", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "taker_majority_days_up", "family": "taker_shape", "key": "taker_buy", "direction": 1, "zh": "过去二十天里主动买多于主动卖的天数多的币，后面表现好", "en": "Coins where aggressive buyers outweigh sellers on many of the last twenty days do better afterwards.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "(Factor('taker_quote_vol').safe_div(Factor('quote_volume')) > 0.5).ts_mean(window=20, min_periods=16)", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "vol_of_vol_down", "family": "vol_shape", "key": "volatility", "direction": -1, "zh": "波动率本身忽高忽低的币难以预测，后面表现差", "en": "Coins whose volatility itself jumps around a lot are unpredictable and do worse afterwards.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "-1 * (Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=1)) - 1).ts_std(window=5, min_periods=4).ts_std(window=60, min_periods=48)", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "down_harder_down", "family": "vol_shape", "key": "return", "direction": 1, "zh": "下跌日跌幅比上涨日涨幅更猛的币，后面表现差", "en": "Coins that move harder on their down days than on their up days do worse afterwards.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "-1 * where((Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=1)) - 1) < 0, (Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=1)) - 1).Abs(), 0).ts_mean(window=30, min_periods=24).safe_div(where((Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=1)) - 1) > 0, (Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=1)) - 1), 0).ts_mean(window=30, min_periods=24))", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "vol_own_high_down", "family": "vol_shape", "key": "volatility", "direction": -1, "zh": "波动率处在自己过去一年高位的币，后面表现差", "en": "A coin whose volatility sits high within its own past year does worse afterwards.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "-1 * (Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=1)) - 1).ts_std(window=20, min_periods=16).ts_rank(window=250, min_periods=200)", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "vol_own_high_up", "family": "vol_shape", "key": "volatility", "direction": 1, "zh": "波动率处在自己过去一年高位的币有资金关注，后面表现好", "en": "A coin whose volatility sits high within its own past year has attention and does better afterwards.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "(Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=1)) - 1).ts_std(window=20, min_periods=16).ts_rank(window=250, min_periods=200)", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "follow_through_up", "family": "return_persistence", "key": "return", "direction": 1, "zh": "日收益容易延续到第二天的币，后面继续涨", "en": "Coins whose daily moves tend to follow through the next day keep rising.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "(Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=1)) - 1).ts_corr((Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=1)) - 1).lag(periods=1), window=60, min_periods=48)", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "next_day_reversal_up", "family": "return_persistence", "key": "return", "direction": -1, "zh": "日收益第二天容易反转的币来回震荡，后面表现好", "en": "Coins whose daily moves tend to reverse the next day do better afterwards.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "-1 * (Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=1)) - 1).ts_corr((Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=1)) - 1).lag(periods=1), window=60, min_periods=48)", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "trades_unstable_down", "family": "trade_shape", "key": "trades", "direction": -1, "zh": "成交笔数每天大起大落的币，后面表现差", "en": "Coins whose number of trades swings around a lot from day to day do worse afterwards.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "-1 * Factor('num_trades').ln().diff(periods=1).Abs().ts_mean(window=20, min_periods=16)", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "trades_unstable_up", "family": "trade_shape", "key": "trades", "direction": 1, "zh": "成交笔数每天大起大落说明资金活跃，后面表现好", "en": "Large day-to-day swings in the number of trades show active money, which is good for later returns.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "Factor('num_trades').ln().diff(periods=1).Abs().ts_mean(window=20, min_periods=16)", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "trades_own_high_up", "family": "trade_shape", "key": "trades", "direction": 1, "zh": "成交笔数处在自己最近区间高位的币，后面表现好", "en": "A coin whose number of trades sits high within its own recent range does better afterwards.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "(Factor('num_trades') - Factor('num_trades').ts_min(window=60, min_periods=48)).safe_div(Factor('num_trades').ts_max(window=60, min_periods=48) - Factor('num_trades').ts_min(window=60, min_periods=48))", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "own_moves_long_down", "family": "market_link", "key": "volatility", "direction": -1, "zh": "过去三个月大盘解释不了的自身波动大的币，后面表现差", "en": "Coins that have moved a lot on their own over the past three months, beyond what the market explains, do worse afterwards.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "-1 * (Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=1)) - 1).demean().ts_std(window=90, min_periods=72)", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "taker_majority_days_down", "family": "taker_shape", "key": "taker_buy", "direction": -1, "zh": "过去二十天里主动买多于主动卖的天数多的币，买盘已经用尽，后面表现差", "en": "Coins where aggressive buyers outweigh sellers on many of the last twenty days have run out of buyers and do worse afterwards.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "-1 * (Factor('taker_quote_vol').safe_div(Factor('quote_volume')) > 0.5).ts_mean(window=20, min_periods=16)", "split": "heldout"}
{"id": "taker_own_high_up", "family": "taker_shape", "key": "taker_buy", "direction": 1, "zh": "主动买入占比处在自己过去三个月高位的币，后面表现好", "en": "A coin whose share of aggressive buying sits high within its own past three months does better afterwards.", "source": "written for prereg 04", "reference": "Factor('taker_quote_vol').safe_div(Factor('quote_volume')).ts_rank(window=90, min_periods=72)", "split": "heldout"}
